


  ┌─ Delete a branch ────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ fix/border is deleted here; a branch of the same name on │
  │ a remote is left alone.                                  │
  │                                                          │
  │ ✕ the commits of fix/border are in no other branch, and  │
  │   only the reflog still names them                       │
  │                                                          │
  │ runs                                                     │
  │ git branch -D -- fix/border                              │
  │                                                          │
  │ type fix/border to go on                                 │
  │ ›                                                      ▌ │
  │                                                          │
  │  enter run it  esc cancel                                │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘




